#: ../../../api/names.md:1
msgid "A collection of defined `name` objects in the workbook."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/names.md:3
msgid ""
"Excel's internal `_xlfn.*` and `_xlpm.*` names are excluded. Hidden user-"
"defined names remain available. The native collection is unchanged. "
"Iteration snapshots name objects so new internal names cannot shift it."
msgstr ""

