msgid ""
"Defines a new name for a range, constant, or formula (including a LAMBDA)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../api/names.md:3
msgid ""
"Full support for named constants and formulas requires Excel desktop or "
"xlwings Lite or Server. Google Sheets supports named ranges only; Office "
"Scripts only returns named ranges in its snapshot."
msgstr ""

